  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients, except sulfur and Na2S・9H2O, and adjust pH to 6.5 with H2SO4. Sterilize by filtration under a N2 atmosphere. Steam sulfur for 3 hr on each of 3 successive days. Neutralize Na2S・9H2O as a 5% solution, and autoclave under a N2 atmosphere. Aseptically and anaerobically add sterile sulfur to the medium. Prior to inoculation, add the sterile Na2S・9H2O solution, and readjust pH to 6.5, if necessary."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Use Medium No. [151] with 2.0 g/L (final) yeast extract, 2.0 g/L (final) peptone and 1.0 g/L Na2S2O3・5H2O, and omit sulfur. Adjust pH to 7.0."
    }
  ]
